    <briefdescription>
<para>The tag type representing an undirected graph configuration. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This tag is used to indicate that a graph is undirected, meaning that its edges do not have a specific direction and can be traversed in both directions between the connected vertices.</para>
